@startuml cgms_safety_flow
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Safety-Critical Flow (IEC 62304)

component Sensor
component Firmware
component Validation
component AlertLogic
component User

Sensor --> Firmware : raw glucose
Firmware --> Validation : processed value
Validation --> AlertLogic : validated glucose
AlertLogic --> User : HIGH / LOW alarm

note right of Validation
Safety Controls:
- Range checks
- Rate-of-change limits
- CRC validation
end note

note right of AlertLogic
Software Safety Class: C
Fail-safe behavior
end note

@enduml
